what is service mesh:
“A Service Mesh is an infrastructure layer used in microservices architecture to manage service-to-service communication. 
It works using sidecar proxies 
like Envoy to handle traffic routing, load balancing, security with mTLS, observability, and fault tolerance without modifying application code.”
___________
What is Sidecar Pattern?

“Sidecar pattern means deploying a helper container alongside the application container inside the same pod.
In service mesh, an Envoy proxy runs as a sidecar container to intercept and manage all network traffic for that service.”
___________________
what is istio?

“Istio is a service mesh platform that runs on Kubernetes to control and secure communication between microservices. 
It provides traffic management, security through mutual TLS Transport Layer Security (mutual Transport Layer Security----mTLS),
and observability like metrics, logs, and tracing.
Istio uses sidecar proxies (Envoy) deployed with each service to control network communication without modifying application code.
